artex-detection-as-code
========================

Contents
--------
1. detection-as-code/  — Detection-as-code tooling: a reproducible Sigma -> SPL
   (Splunk) + KQL (Microsoft Sentinel) build with per-target pySigma processing
   pipelines, a pinned sigma-cli toolchain (Dockerfile + requirements.lock), a
   build script and a Makefile. Original work.
2. detections/sigma/   — Sigma detection rules (atomic + correlation) derived
   from the ARTEX project.

